<title>SINGAPORE: WBL Corp to export China health products.</title>
<headline>WBL Corp to export China health products.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's WBL Corp Ltd said on Wednesday its subsidiary in China had agreed to a deal under which U.S.-based Generation Health Inc (GH) will market and distribute its cholesterol control product in the United States, Europe and Japan.</p>
<p>WBL said in a statement that the agreement involved a 20-year export programme in which Wearnes Beida Biotech Co Ltd would export some US$2.0 billion worth of the health product through GH.</p>
<p>The first export shipment, worth US$2.0 million, would be towards the end of 1996 and volume shipments would increase progressively from 1997, it said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
